  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed mansard extension, by reason of its bulk and orientation to the neighbouring property would cause detrimental loss of light and an increased sense of enclosure to occupiers of no. 81 Old Church Lane,. As such, the development is contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed mansard roof extension would have an excessive scale, top heavy design and appear out of keeping with the prevailing roof forms in the streetscene, causing an incongruous and dominating and visually harmful appearance to the character of the street scene. As such, the proposal is therefore contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
